# KiCad-IOS port patch 0031 (wxWidgets v3.3, wxWindows licence)
# Round 21: wxQt STC keyboard bridge. wxStyledTextCtrl on wxQt
# is a plain custom-painted QWidget (ScintillaWX) with no text
# input plumbing on this port: wxHAS_TEXT_INPUT_CLIENT exists
# only for GTK and Cocoa, wxQt implements no wxTextInputClient,
# and nothing set WA_InputMethodEnabled, implemented
# inputMethodEvent/inputMethodQuery, or called
# QInputMethod::show() for a generic QWidget (the winevent.h
# inputMethodEvent stub sat commented out). Hardware keys reach
# the STC, but the iOS virtual keyboard never appears for it and
# committed text has no channel in -- every STC main-text dialog
# is untypable on device (field properties via Scintilla, text
# properties, table-cell properties, sim model code fields).
# This patch bridges the input method to wxStyledTextCtrl
# windows ONLY, identified by RTTI class name so wxCore needs
# no STC dependency:
#  - PostCreation and the focus handler set
#    Qt::WA_InputMethodEnabled on the STC widget;
#  - wxQtEventSignalHandler (winevent.h) overrides
#    inputMethodEvent/inputMethodQuery and forwards to the new
#    wxWindowQt handlers; a handler that declines (every non-STC
#    window) falls through to the widget's default Qt behaviour,
#    byte-identical to before this patch;
#  - inputMethodQuery answers ImEnabled (true) and
#    ImCursorRectangle (a rect at the widget origin; approximate
#    is fine for keyboard placement), invalid QVariant otherwise;
#  - inputMethodEvent delivers commitString characters as
#    wxEVT_CHAR events via ProcessWindowEvent -- the channel
#    hardware keys already use (STC::OnChar -> DoAddChar);
#  - focus gain/loss on an STC window calls
#    QInputMethod::show()/hide().
# v1 limitation, noted honestly: the preedit (composition)
# string is ignored; only committed text is delivered, which is
# what the iOS keyboard sends for plain typing.
# Gate literal: "round21-stc-input-method-bridge" (wxLogTrace,
# mask "kicad-ios-round21").
# Apply with: patch -p1 (from the wx source root), after
# patches 0001-0030.
#
